    "summary": {
      "value": "Invocations improve Attributes."
    },
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Invoker</strong>.</p><hr><p>After you perform an <strong>invocation</strong> during a conflict, you <strong>and</strong> up to one ally you can see increase one of your Attributes' die sizes by one (up to a maximum of <strong>d12</strong>). This increase lasts until the end of the scene or until you use this Skill again, and the Attribute is based on the <strong>wellspring</strong> you invoked: <strong>air (Insight)</strong>, <strong>earth (one Attribute of your choice)</strong>, <strong>fire (Dexterity)</strong>, <strong>lightning (Might)</strong>, or <strong>water (Willpower)</strong>.</p>",
